# the page pictures (screenshots to look at): every page, with values that show something.
# Pages: 0 Play 1 1 Play 2 2 Tone 1 3 Tone 2 4 Osc 5 Source 6 LFO depths 7 LFO mods 8 Partner 9 Setup 1 10 Setup 2
# 11 Setup 3 12 Swell 13 Delay 14 Reverb.
tap PLAY
wait 1500
shot play.png
# Play 2: drone I resonant, drone II quieter
tap HOME
expect view 1
spin K2 50
spin K3 -30
wait 300
shot play2.png
# Tone: drone I a little pinkish noise under its tones, drone II white noise at the top (then both back to none)
tap ENV
expect view 2
spin K1 30
spin K2 -40
spin K3 100
spin K4 -100
wait 1500
shot tone.png
spin K1 -30
spin K3 -100
# Tone 2: some character and feedback
tap ENV
expect view 3
spin K1 40
spin K2 25
wait 1500
shot tone2.png
spin K1 -40
spin K2 -25
# Osc: drone I between saw and square, drone II on triangle
tap EDIT
expect view 4
spin K1 15
spin K2 25
spin K3 -100
spin K3 33
wait 300
shot osc.png
# Source: drone I driven with some sub, drone II as it starts
tap EDIT
expect view 5
spin K1 20
spin K2 50
wait 2500
shot source.png
# LFO: Wave I a triangle, Wave II an exp saw; some depth on each drone's filter
tap LFO
expect view 6
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
spin SELECT -20
spin K2 30
spin K4 -20
tapkey b0
tapkey b8
tapkey b8
tapkey b3
tapkey b3
wait 2500
shot lfo.png
# LFO mods: the rate mod, cross-mod's amount, the delay LFO's depth
tap LFO
expect view 7
spin K1 40
spin K3 20
spin K4 50
wait 300
shot lfo2.png
# Partner (SEQ): drone I detuned (beating), drone II an octave up and a fifth
tap SEQ
expect view 8
spin K2 40
spin K3 3
wait 300
shot partner.png
# Setup: some glide, drift and stereo
tap GLO
expect view 9
spin K1 30
spin K3 50
wait 300
shot setup.png
# Setup 2: Morph, Scene switch, Tune, Tuning
tap GLO
expect view 10
spin K2 20
spin K3 20
wait 300
shot setup2.png
# Setup 3: the speaker's low cut on, the keys a little more sensitive (then both back)
tap GLO
expect view 11
spin K1 30
spin K2 20
wait 300
shot setup3.png
spin K1 -30
spin K2 -20
# Pulse (hold ARP for its page; a tap starts it): some swing
expect par55 1
press ARP
expect view 12
spin K4 30
wait 2500
shot pulse.png
release ARP
# Delay: Wide, its echoes left and right
tap FX
expect view 13
spin K1 1
spin K3 20
spin K4 20
wait 300
shot fx.png
# Reverb: the cathedral's tail, a little longer
tap FX
expect view 14
spin K2 10
spin K4 10
wait 300
shot fx2.png
# SEL held: the black keys' map (the normal layer: drone II's partner on, as the start has it)
tap HOME
wait 300
press SEL
wait 200
expect keymap 0
wait 400
expect keymap 1
wait 300
shot keymap.png
spin K2 1
expect keymap 0
release SEL
